## 1. DEFINITIONS

**“Software”** means the Brawl Busters Emulator, including all source code, tools, and documentation in this repository.

**“Modified Version”** means any work based on the Software that includes changes, additions, deletions, or derivative code.

**“Server”** means any service, application, or instance that runs the Software (modified or unmodified) to provide gameplay, API access, or related functionality.

**“Commercial Use”** means using the Software to generate revenue, including but not limited to:
- Charging access fees or subscriptions
- Selling in-game advantages, items, or features
- Paywalls or paid premium access
- Donations or funding explicitly tied to gameplay advantages, access, or features of the Server or Software
- Selling the Software or Modified Versions

General voluntary donations with no in-game or service benefit are not considered Commercial Use.

